  "body": "The example following https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#dom-li-value makes it clear that the `value` attribute on the DOM interface of an `<li>` element reflects only the literal value of the attribute, if applicable.\r\n\r\nThere does not appear to be a way to programmatically access the [ordinal value](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#ordinal-value) of the `<li>` node, and therefore no way to manipulate it directly.",
